__pycache__/
*.pyc
.DS_Store
# Secrets defence-in-depth (D57, 2026-11-14): the kit repo tracks no
# .env / key files today (verified: `git ls-files` shows none), but
# nothing stopped one being added by accident — the draft's §(a) rule
# ("commit .gitignore FIRST, before any .env exists") was never applied
# to this repo itself. These entries are the product-repo list from
# hackathon-security §2, minus the Supabase/Convex paths that do not
# exist here. A tracked file is NOT ignored by this change (gitignore
# never un-tracks); a future accidental `git add .env` is refused.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key
# Installer output: the upstream Impeccable hook installer writes
# <repo>/.codex/hooks.json (a project hook) when install.sh runs; it is
# machine-local installer output, never committed. (install.sh promotes
# it to ~/.codex/hooks.json and removes the project copy.) Root-only:
# the pattern must not match a .codex/ dir nested in a subproject.
/.codex/
